%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"fontSize": "18px"}, "flowchart": {"nodeSpacing": 42, "rankSpacing": 58}}}%%
flowchart TB
  USER[Enterprise user] --> BROWSER[Browser: React SPA]
  BROWSER -->|loopback HTTP and one-time launch token| API[FastAPI + Uvicorn<br/>127.0.0.1:ephemeral port]

  subgraph LocalApp[Local MigraAI process]
    direction TB
    subgraph ApiLayer[API layer]
      direction LR
      API --> AUTH[AuthState and security middleware<br/>launch token, session cookie, CSRF]
      API --> SESSION[Session API and in-memory inventory]
    end
    subgraph ServiceLayer[Services and workflows]
      direction TB
      DISC[Upload API and DiscoveryRunner]
      PLAN[Planning API<br/>local draft or PlanJob]
      CONV[ConversionJob]
      PACK[Package snapshot, ZIP, and report builders]
      DISC --> STORE[Encrypted upload files<br/>temporary session directory]
      CONV --> WF[LangGraph batch workflow<br/>context, vote, consensus, validation, score]
      WF --> KB[(Versioned SQLite knowledge base<br/>FTS5 and sqlite-vec)]
      WF --> VALID[SQL and object validation checks]
      WF --> CLIENT[Devin session client<br/>create, poll, cancel]
      WF -->|low-confidence objects in a batch| ESC[One escalation session for that batch]
      PACK --> ZIP[Converted ZIP]
      PACK --> REPORT[Session reports]
    end
    API --> DISC
    API --> PLAN
    API --> CONV
    API --> PACK
    API --> DATA[(Default: %LOCALAPPDATA%\MigraAI<br/>MIGRAAI_DATA_DIR can override<br/>app.db, kb/, logs/, sessions/ wiped at start/exit)]
  end

  subgraph External[Internet services, outbound HTTPS]
    direction TB
    DV[(Devin API)]
    DOCS[Vendor documentation sites]
  end
  CLIENT -->|conversion source context after explicit consent| DV
  ESC -->|batch escalation after consent| DV
  PLAN -->|"plan prompt with aggregate inventory counts only,<br/>when Devin planning is configured"| DV
  KB -. optional KB refresh .-> DOCS
  ZIP --> BROWSER
  REPORT --> BROWSER
